    "title": "About Tessellate — Tessellate",
    "text": "Skip to content\nTessellate\nStart building\n\nOPEN INTERFACE COMMONS\n\nAbout Tessellate\n\nAn open interface intelligence layer for people and agents.\n\nA coherent product, not a pile of components\n\nDescribe a product, inspect its inferred architecture, compare three directions and edit a validated manifest in Workbench. Composition, audit and export run without an LLM.\n\nOpen and portable\n\nThe public resource source is free. Standalone exports contain React, TypeScript and Tailwind source without a Tessellate runtime dependency.\n\nThis review version\n\nProjects and collections are stored in your browser. Authentication, shared server persistence and community publishing require the canonical API deployment; this review does not pretend those services are connected.\n\nRepository and contributions\nDocumentation\nInspect resource licences\n\nAbout\nDocs\nLicences\nPrivacy\nTerms\nSupport the commons\nSource on GitHub",
